{"chapter": "etale-cohomology", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0EW7", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$\\pi_S^{-1}\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\pi_S^{-1}\\mathcal{F}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-describe-pullback}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-describe-pullback-pi-ph}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:df1ef7e2f6975d43a308241f12a0347b787eae29b430860879678e54589ad2c8", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7436bcb3347370f6c0db7aa5551233b06151f32efbb4faabb40afff434d8372f", "source_text": "The statement about the <ACCENT_0001>tale topology is the content\nof Lemma <REF_0001>. To finish the proof it\nsuffices to show that <MATH_0001> is a sheaf for the h\ntopology. However, in Lemma <REF_0002>\nwe have shown that\n<MATH_0002> is a sheaf even in the stronger ph\ntopology.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c1222e02afd50adf7ec6b6fc12b4b9ab64997dca277ee29c5e493e62bf59d5d2", "unit_id": "tag:0EW8:proof"}
